界面参数配置 (Interface Parameters)
主要参数 (Sliders/Choosers/Switches)

authority-regime: chooser ["no-ai" "advisor" "pure-voter" "hybrid-voter"]
centralized?: switch (on/off)
coverage: slider (0.0 to 1.0, default 0.5, increment 0.1)
wAI: slider (0 to 10, default 1, increment 0.5)
A: slider (0.5 to 1.0, default 0.75, increment 0.05)
N: slider (10 to 100, default 30, increment 5)
rounds: slider (10 to 500, default 100, increment 10)
meanTrust: slider (0.0 to 1.0, default 0.6, increment 0.1)
sdTrust: slider (0.0 to 0.5, default 0.15, increment 0.05)
meanConform: slider (0.0 to 1.0, default 0.5, increment 0.1)
sdConform: slider (0.0 to 0.5, default 0.15, increment 0.05)

监视器 (Monitors)
Primary Outcomes
 
accuracy
cascade-rate
false-convergence
polarisation
Secondary Outcomes
 
confidence-calibration
influence-inequality
conflict-burden
Trust Metrics
 
mean-trust
trust-miscalibration
trust-bias
trust-drift
Descriptive Stats
 
regime-summary
access-rate
outvoted-count
ai-vote-impact
图表 (Plots)
